# Build context for infra/container/Dockerfile — shared by both targets.
#
# It is an ALLOWLIST: exclude everything, then name what may be sent. That
# direction is deliberate. The production target does `COPY . /app`, so anything
# reachable here lands in an image that gets pushed to a registry and run on a
# rented machine. A denylist that forgets one entry leaks a private key; an
# allowlist that forgets one entry breaks the build. Only one of those failures
# is recoverable.
#
# Two things must never appear here, and they are not merely absent by luck —
# nothing below re-includes them: `server/certs` (a TLS private key) and
# `server/.secrets` (an Apple auth key, a Cloudflare API token). Same for `.env`.
#
# The `tools/` list mirrors the allowlist in .gitignore, which is the maintained
# definition of Maurice's public surface: the thirteen private tools are
# symlinks into the maurice-tools repo and stay out. The `web/` exclusions are
# the same private paths .gitignore names. A new private path that nobody adds
# here would be COPYed as a dangling symlink — which is why the production stage
# fails the build on dangling symlinks rather than shipping one.
#
# BuildKit reads this file because it is named after the Dockerfile.

*

# ── The server ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
!server
server/node_modules
server/certs
server/.secrets
server/test

# ── The garden engine ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
!web
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/.garden-roots
web/.astro
# Only the bundled demo garden ships; real gardens are personal content.
web/gardens/*
!web/gardens/demo
!web/gardens/gardens.json
# Generated per-install symlinks into the gardens dir (download-images.ts).
web/public/images/*
!web/public/images/demo
web/public/avatars
# Private pages, components, helpers and theme — symlinks into maurice-web.
web/themes/candide
web/src/pages/books
web/src/pages/briefings
web/src/pages/compte
web/src/pages/feeds
web/src/pages/fiches
web/src/pages/library
web/src/pages/research
web/src/pages/signals
web/src/pages/tasks
web/src/pages/fr/fiches
web/src/pages/fr/reves
web/src/components/CommandPalette.astro
web/src/components/FichesList.astro
web/src/lib/compte-api.ts
web/src/lib/dossier-api.ts
web/src/lib/tasks-api.ts

# ── The public tools ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
!tools/__init__.py
!tools/README.md
!tools/garden
!tools/shared
!tools/mcp_gateway
!tools/corpus
# …minus the corpus's own artefacts: 730 MB of vector store, plus a config that
# names absolute paths on the machine that wrote it.
tools/corpus/data
tools/corpus/logs
tools/corpus/.venv
tools/corpus/config/corpus.yaml

# ── Launch scripts and this directory ────────────────────────────────────────
!scripts
!infra/container
# The model roster, read at repo root by tools/shared/model_config.py.
!models.yml

# ── Never, at any depth ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/.DS_Store
**/._*
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/.env
